"""Process audit wrapper and reporter for hwspecs campaigns.

Subcommands:
  run (or default with `--`)
      Wrap a `hwspecs <subcmd> ...` invocation without mutating argv by default,
      tee stdout/stderr unchanged, hash target `.spec.yaml` files before and after,
      parse text or JSON findings into scrubbed `(tool_commit, code_or_slug)` counts,
      and atomically publish `bringup-audit-1` (`audit/runs/<exec-id>/`) and
      `hwspecs-diag-1` (`audit/hwspecs/<event-id>-<subcmd>.json`) receipts.
      Emits `audit/gates/<event-id>/gate-clean.json` once per spec root when
      `check` or `resolve` transitions from failing (`errors > 0`) to clean
      (`errors == 0`).
  record-issue
      Record a `hwspecs` tool defect or workaround in
      `audit/issues/<event-id>/tool-issue.json`.
  record-verified
      Record a verifier round summary in `review/<spec>-r<n>/verified.json`.
  record-subagent
      Append a subagent spawn/completion notice to `audit/subagents.jsonl`.
  report
      Aggregate campaign receipts into gate edit cycles, no-op reruns,
      finding persistence, tool-defect vs. spec-defect cycle attribution,
      verifier round summaries, subagent token/duration summaries, and
      explicit coverage disclosure (`unknown` when uncaptured, never `0`).
"""

